    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nGood morning, it's raining.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nLet's chat today.\n\n[Verse]\nRaindrops tapping on the window pane,\nLearning words in this cozy lane.\nGood afternoon… Buenas tardes\nFeeling fine, no complaints.\nPlease… Por favor\nPass the coffee, I say.\nYou're welcome… De nada\nSmiling as we play.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nLet's chat today.\n\n[Verse]\nThe rain keeps falling, skies are gray,\nBut our spirits are bright anyway.\nGood night… Buenas noches\nTime to rest, it's okay.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor this day, I pray.\nGoodbye… Adiós\nTill tomorrow's play.\n\n[Bridge]\nSitting by the fire's glow,\nLearning more as the embers blow.\nVery well… Muy bien\nLife's a dance, you know.\nWith every word, we grow.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nLet's chat today.\n\n[Outro]",
    vocab: [{"es":"hola","en":"hello"},{"es":"buenos días","en":"good morning"},{"es":"buenas tardes","en":"good afternoon"},{"es":"buenas noches","en":"good night"},{"es":"¿cómo estás?","en":"how are you?"},{"es":"muy bien","en":"very well"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thank you"},{"es":"por favor","en":"please"},{"es":"de nada","en":"you're welcome"},{"es":"adiós","en":"goodbye"},{"es":"me llamo...","en":"my name is..."},{"es":"soy de...","en":"I am from..."},{"es":"hasta luego","en":"see you later"},{"es":"con permiso","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"lo siento","en":"I'm sorry"}],
