    lyrics: "[Intro]\n¡Vamos!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nGreetings… Saludos  \nLet's shop today.\n\n[Verse]\nWalking through the store,  \nlooking for something new.  \nA greeting… Un saludo  \nto the clerk we meet.  \nBirthday… Cumpleaños  \nis coming up soon.  \nA meeting… Una reunión  \nto plan the fun.  \n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nGreetings… Saludos  \nLet's shop today.\n\n[Verse]\nInvitation… Invitación  \nto a party tonight.  \nAfternoon… Tarde  \nwe'll find the perfect dress.  \nNight… Noche  \nis when the fun begins.  \nA week… Una semana  \nof celebrations ahead.\n\n[Bridge]\nA gift… Un regalo  \nfor the birthday girl.  \nA surprise… Una sorpresa  \nthat makes her smile.  \nThank you… Gracias  \nfor the lovely day.  \nYou're welcome… De nada  \nit's what friends do.\n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nGreetings… Saludos  \nLet's shop today.\n\n[Outro]\nFiesta… Fiesta  \nlet's celebrate.  \nHola… Hola  \nlet's have a great day!",
