    lyrics: "\"\"\"\n[Intro]\n¡Vamos al mercado!\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCounting with me… Contando conmigo\nFour, five, six… Cuatro, cinco, seis\nMarket mix… Mezcla del mercado\n\n[Verse]\nAdd… Añadir\nFruits in my basket, watch them piling.\nLess… Menos\nToo many, need to slow this.\nGroup… Grupo\nFolks all around, colors and sound.\nExceed… Exceder\nCrowds growing, can't take the heat.\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCounting with me… Contando conmigo\nFour, five, six… Cuatro, cinco, seis\nMarket mix… Mezcla del mercado\n\n[Verse]\nSubtract… Restar\nSome veggies, can't carry that.\nDouble… Doblar\nPrices rise, got to be wise.\nTriple… Triplicar\nThe fun, when the day is done.\nHalf… Mitad\nOf my list, still things to list.\n\n[Bridge]\nA quarter… Un cuarto\nOf my cash, spent in a flash.\nThe fifth… El quinto\nApple, I save for a gift.\nFifteen… Quince\nApples in total, feeling genuine.\nOne… Uno\nMore stop, then I'm done.\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCounting with me… Contando conmigo",
